{
  "operators": [
    {
      "name": "custom_triu",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "x",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[batch, channels, height, width]",
          "layout": "supports strides",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "diagonal",
          "kind": "int",
          "default": 1,
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": true
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "same as x"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 x = torch.triu(x, diagonal=1)",
        "对输入 tensor 的最后两个维度，将主对角线下方（不含主对角线）且满足 col - row < diagonal 的元素置零，其余元素保持不变",
        "diagonal=1 表示保留严格上三角部分（不含主对角线），主对角线及以下全部置零",
        "支持任意 batch 维度，仅对最后两维进行三角掩码操作",
        "输入可为任意 stride，kernel 需按实际 stride 访问，不假设连续布局",
        "输出 shape、dtype、device 与输入一致"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "custom_abs",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "x",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[batch, channels, height, width]",
          "layout": "supports strides",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "same as x"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 x = torch.abs(x)",
        "对输入 tensor 逐元素计算绝对值",
        "支持任意 shape 和 stride",
        "输出 shape、dtype、device 与输入一致"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "reference_steps": [
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_001",
      "source": "x = torch.triu(x, diagonal=1)",
      "semantics": [
        "对输入 x 的最后两个维度应用上三角掩码，diagonal=1 表示保留严格上三角部分（不含主对角线），主对角线及以下全部置零",
        "输出 tensor 与输入 shape、dtype、device 相同"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_002",
      "source": "x = torch.abs(x)",
      "semantics": [
        "对前一步结果逐元素取绝对值",
        "输出 tensor 与输入 shape、dtype、device 相同"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_003",
      "source": "return x",
      "semantics": [
        "返回最终结果，shape、dtype、device 与前一步相同"
      ]
    }
  ]
}